    "text": "RAG stands for Retrieval Augmented Generation. In a RAG system, we first retrieve relevant context from indexed documents and then pass that context to an LLM to generate a grounded answer. Embeddings convert text into vectors so that semantically similar text can be found even when exact keywords do not match. Vector stores save these embeddings and support similarity search.",
